# --- Railway demo deploy (Echo demo box): intentionally NOT ignored ---
# railway.json / railway-entrypoint.sh / railway-seed.py must NOT be gitignored:
# `railway up` only uploads files that aren't gitignored, so ignoring them would
# stop them deploying.
#
# They are TRACKED, on the `resolutions-demo` branch only. This comment used to
# say "leave them untracked", which stopped being true and was misleading about
# the thing that actually matters. The real rule is:
#
#   they must never reach an UPSTREAM-BOUND branch (`chapter-tools` and friends),
#   because railway.json's startCommand auto-runs railway-seed.py on boot and
#   nobody reviewing a feature PR expects a deploy config that seeds the database.
#
# Before opening any upstream PR, check the branch is clean:
#   git ls-files | grep -i railway     # must print nothing